event: delegated_tool_result
data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"output":"{\"content\":\"# Daily Self-Evolution Monitor — Day 02\\n**Date:** 2026-05-26\\n**Task Family:** `precipitation_seed`\\n**Predecessor Evidence Chain:** day-01 precipitation_seed, day-01 audit_summary (59 governance artifacts, 14,018 lines)\\n**Source Evidence:** 60 governance artifacts, 3 agent-replay logs, 1 mission-state file, 32 available_skills/ entries, 11 skills/ packages\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Stable Refs — Canonical Data Sources\\n\\nThe following paths and endpoints are stable across restarts and runs. All probes should reference these only.\\n\\n| Ref | Path / Endpoint | Type | Stability |\\n|-----|----------------|------|-----------|\\n| `R1` | `shared/.omc/state/mission-state.json` | Mission lifecycle state (JSON) | ✅ Survives restart. 3 missions, 5 agents. |\\n| `R2` | `shared/.omc/state/agent-replay-*.jsonl` | Agent execution telemetry (JSONL) | ✅ Append-only. Survives restart. Events: `agent_start`, `agent_stop`, `duration_ms`, `success`. |\\n| `R3` | `shared/self_evolution_*.md` | Governance artifact chain (Markdown) | ✅ Append-only, monotonically growing. Present after each probe cycle. |\\n| `R4` | `available_skills/*/` | Skill projection root directories | ✅ Survives restart. Pre-existing + pipeline-produced skills. |\\n| `R5` | `skills/*/` | Source-root skill definitions | ✅ Survives restart. Mirrored to `available_skills/`. |\\n| `R6` | `.omc/state/mission-state.json` | Workspace-scoped mission state (secondary) | ✅ Survives restart. May be empty. |\\n| `R7` | `~/.macaca/mcp.yaml` | MCP server runtime config | ✅ Pre-installed servers only. Not mutated by probes. |\\n| `R8` | `~/.macaca/skills/*/_meta.json` | Global skill metadata (pre-existing only) | ✅ Read-only. Not pipeline-produced. |\\n| `R9` | `*/.macaca/skill-mutation-mementos/*.json` | Mutation provenance records | ✅ Append-only. 29 mementos recorded. |\\n\\n**Not stable (do not use as refs):**\\n- `/api/self-evolution/proposals` — legacy endpoint, 404 since Run 35\\n- `/api/apps/*/skills/operat...[truncated, 21717 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"2b2ff4f9-33ad-49c1-b19b-0b3ff0c2d230"}

