data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"output":"{\"content\":\"# Daily Self-Evolution Monitor — Day 02\\n**Task Family:** `reuse_followup`\\n**Date:** 2026-05-26\\n**Predecessor Artifacts:**\\n- `precipitation_seed` (day-02) — refreshed counters C1–C25, stable refs R1–R9\\n- `reuse_followup` (day-01) — full skill inventory, telemetry zero baseline, per-skill Phase 3–5 verdicts\\n- `audit_summary` (day-01) — 59-governance-artifact chain at 14,018 lines\\n\\n**Method:** Bounded filesystem inspection. Application-neutral. No mutations.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Visible Skills — Complete Inventory (Day 02)\\n\\n### 1.1 Convention-Compliant Skills (SKILL.md + `_meta.json` with valid schema)\\n\\nThese 4 skills remain the only convention-compliant entries. Unchanged from day-01.\\n\\n| # | Directory | Slug | Version | publishedAt | `proposal_id`? |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| 1 | `playwright_mcp` | `playwright-mcp` | `1.0.0` | 1770565004575 | ❌ |\\n| 2 | `crypto_market` | `crypto` | `1.0.6` | 1773795808760 | ❌ |\\n| 3 | `stock_analysis` | `stock-analysis` | `6.2.0` | 1770041353575 | ❌ |\\n| 4 | `weather` | `weather` | `1.0.0` | 1767545394459 | ❌ |\\n\\nAll 4 mirrored to `~/.macaca/skills/` (global registry). All carry only `ownerId`/`slug`/`version`/`publishedAt`. Zero pipeline provenance.\\n\\n### 1.2 Pre-installed Skills (SKILL.md only, no `_meta.json`)\\n\\nUnchanged from day-01. These 11 pre-installed directories have no `_meta.json`:\\n\\n| # | Directory |\\n|---|---|\\n| 5 | `chronicle` |\\n| 6 | `figma` |\\n| 7 | `figma_mcp` |\\n| 8 | `gitnexus_cli` |\\n| 9 | `gitnexus_debugging` |\\n| 10 | `gitnexus_exploring` |\\n| 11 | `gitnexus_guide` |\\n| 12 | `gitnexus_impact_analysis` |\\n| 13 | `gitnexus_pr_review` |\\n| 14 | `gitnexus_refactoring` |\\n| 15 | `golang` |\\n| 16 | `openspec` |\\n| 17 | `shadcn_ui` |\\n\\n### 1.3 Pipeline-Produced Skills (Day-01 vintage, SKILL.md only)\\n\\nThese 9 directories existed at day-01 and persist at day-02. All lack `_meta.json`.\\n\\n| # | Directory | SKILL.md Content Type | Mutation Memento |\\n|---|---|---|--...[truncated, 31778 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"2b2ff4f9-33ad-49c1-b19b-0b3ff0c2d230"}

