data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"output":"{\"content\":\"# Daily Self-Evolution Monitor — Day 02\\n**Task Family:** `optimization_probe`\\n**Date:** 2026-05-26\\n**Predecessor Artifacts:**\\n- `self_evolution_2026-05-26_day-02_precipitation_seed.md` — refreshed counters C1–C25, deltas from day-01\\n- `self_evolution_2026-05-26_day-02_reuse_followup.md` — per-skill inventory (32 skills), precipitation score 18.4/100, mirroring bijection violations\\n- `self_evolution_2026-05-25_day-01_optimization_probe.md` — day-01 baseline: all 26 skills scored 0/6, no-change decision, 10 missing metrics (M1–M10)\\n- `self_evolution_skill_optimization_merge_archive_rules.md` — post-precipitation lifecycle governance rules (3 domains, 12 thresholds)\\n- `self_evolution_agent_skill_precipitation_checklist.md` — 8-phase precipitation framework\\n\\n**Method:** Telemetry-oriented criteria audit (T1–T6) across all 32 visible skills. Bounded inspection only. Application-neutral. No mutations.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Telemetry-Oriented Review Criteria\\n\\nUnchanged from day-01. Optimization requires a closed-loop substrate:\\n\\n```\\nObservation (metric capture) → Analysis (delta detection) → Intervention (optimized procedure) → Re-observation (metric re-capture)\\n```\\n\\nEach skill is assessed against **6 telemetry-oriented criteria**:\\n\\n| Criterion | ID | Definition | Evidence Path |\\n|-----------|----|------------|--------------|\\n| **Invocation Tracking** | `T1` | Per-skill count of how many times the skill was invoked | `_usage.json` → `invocationCount` field, or `activation_count` in telemetry aggregate |\\n| **Duration Baseline** | `T2` | Execution duration captured before and after an intervention | `agent-replay-*.jsonl` → `duration_ms` field, or `completedSummary` with timing data |\\n| **Failure Rate** | `T3` | Retry count and failure reason per skill invocation | `last-tool-error.json` with `retry_count` + `skill_id` cross-ref, or per-invocation error log |\\n| **Tool/Token Cost** | `T4` | Tool-call count or token to...[truncated, 44378 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"2b2ff4f9-33ad-49c1-b19b-0b3ff0c2d230"}

