data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"output":"{\"content\":\"# Self-Evolution Daily Monitor — Day 02\\n## Task Family: `duplicate_merge_probe`\\n\\n**Date:** 2026-05-26  \\n**Run scope:** Bounded filesystem evidence only. Generic, application-neutral.  \\n**Method:** Slug similarity, trigger/description overlap, procedure overlap, telemetry evidence cross-reference.  \\n**Baseline reference:** `self_evolution_2026-05-25_day-01_duplicate_merge_probe.md` (26 skills, 8 merge-candidate pairs, 4 merge actions recommended).  \\n**No skills were mutated, created, or deleted in this report.**\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Inventory Delta — Day 01 → Day 02\\n\\nThe `available_skills/` directory grew from **26 → 32 directories** (+6) between day-01 and day-02. All six new entries are **auto-generated template-clone skills**, expanding the clone cluster identified in day-01 §4.\\n\\n### 1.1 — New Skills Since Day 01\\n\\n| # | Directory | Slug (from frontmatter) | Created | Timestamp |\\n|---|-----------|--------------------------|---------|-----------|\\n| N1 | `evaluation_telemetry_optimization` | `evaluation-telemetry-optimization` | 2026-05-26 | 00:27 |\\n| N2 | `linked_event_execution_trace_refs_repeat_involving_evaluation` | `linked-event-execution-trace-refs-repeat-involving-evaluation` | 2026-05-26 | 00:27 |\\n| N3 | `materialization_governance_telemetry_optimization` | `materialization-governance-telemetry-optimization` | 2026-05-26 | 00:27 |\\n| N4 | `materialization_registry_load_path_activation_telemetry` | `materialization-registry-load-path-activation-telemetry` | 2026-05-26 | 00:27 |\\n| N5 | `materialization_telemetry_validation_optimization` | `materialization-telemetry-validation-optimization` | 2026-05-26 | 00:27 |\\n| N6 | `telemetry_registry` | `telemetry-registry` | 2026-05-26 | 00:27 |\\n\\n### 1.2 — Accumulated Inventory Summary\\n\\n| Cluster | Day-01 Count | Day-02 Count | Δ | Directories |\\n|---------|-------------|-------------|---|-------------|\\n| **Figma design** | 2 | 2 | 0 | `figma`, `figma_mcp` |\\n| **GitNexus** | ...[truncated, 43113 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"2b2ff4f9-33ad-49c1-b19b-0b3ff0c2d230"}

